# Evidence anchors — prov:Entity individuals whose rdfs:label names a
# repo-relative path (with owning symbol/lines) in the frozen-duckdb
# repository at v1.5.5 wave 4 (docs/sjira/v26.9.21). Gates refuse dangling
# anchors: every prov:wasDerivedFrom target must be a declared prov:Entity
# with an rdfs:label.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

<urn:frozen-duckdb:evidence:workspace-cargo-toml> a prov:Entity ;
